---
// HowItWorksPaso3.astro — Paso 3 de Cómo funciona
---

<article class="step-card" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="3">
  <div class="step-top">
    <div class="step-head">
      <span class="step-badge" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
    </div>
    <h3 class="step-title">Paso 3 · Emite y envía.</h3>
    <p class="step-text">
      «Emitir DeCA» emite todas las cargas listas de ese transportista. Cada DeCA sale en PDF con su QR, y se lo envías al transportista por correo desde su ficha.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="step-image-wrap">
    <img
      src="/img/paso-3.webp"
      alt="4 DeCA emitidos en PDF con QR y botón Enviar al transportista"
      width="1920"
      height="1440"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
      class="step-image"
    />
  </div>
</article>

<style>
  .step-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-canvas, var(--palette-slate-50));
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 10px);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    height: 100%;
    transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease-out), box-shadow 0.25s var(--ease-out), border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .step-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.25);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04), 0 10px 20px -3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
    }
  }

  .step-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .step-badge {
    width: 2.125rem;
    height: 2.125rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background-color: var(--palette-emerald-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--palette-emerald-200);
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .step-text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary, var(--palette-slate-600));
    margin: 0;
  }

  .step-image-wrap {
    margin-top: auto;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.14);
    background-color: var(--color-ink, #0a0f0d);
  }

  .step-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .step-card {
      transition: none !important;
      transform: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
